              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " vessel or a heavy casserole dish. The key spice blend is "
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "ras el hanout ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "glossaryTooltip",
                "attrs": {
                  "termSlug": "ras-el-hanout-spice"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": ", sold in most supermarkets. The prunes are added in the final 30 minutes so they retain some texture."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Brown the lamb in batches. Crowding the pan steams rather than browns the meat, and you will lose the fond that builds flavour in the sauce."
          }
        ]
      },
